		<div class="fsSummary">
			<p>Fall of 26, Quarter 1 is full. Please have your student email Lora Gaudreault at&nbsp;<a href="mailto:lgaudshs@buusd.org" target="_blank">lgaudshs@buusd.org</a>&nbsp;with their permit number and date of issue to secure a spot for Q2, Q3, or Q4 of the 26/27 School Year.&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>

		</div>




</article>
